#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1441
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Installacion"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1447
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to obtain &ktts;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1453
#, no-c-format
msgid "&install.intro.documentation;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1457
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Debian Install Command: <command>apt-get install kdeaccessibility</command>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1460
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will find links to source and binary packages on the <ulink url=\"http://"
"accessibility.kde.org/developer/kttsd/\"> &kde; Accessibility</ulink> web "
"site (http://accessibility.kde.org)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1464
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have access to the &kde; code repository, you can download &ktts; by "
"checking out the <command>kdeaccessibility</command> module. &ktts; will be "
"found in the <command>kttsd</command> folder. You can also download tarballs "
"of the kdeaccessibility source code from <ulink url=\"ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/"
"kde/\"> ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1478
#, no-c-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1480
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mandatory requirements:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1484
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; version 4.4 or later."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1485
#, no-c-format
msgid "speech-dispatcher version 0.67 or later."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1486
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A speech synthesizer. The following synthesizers and spoken languages are "
"currently supported."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1495
#, no-c-format
msgid "Espeak"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1496
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most languages, check <ulink url=\"http://espeak.sourceforge.net/languages."
"html\">http://espeak.sourceforge.net/languages.html</ulink> for the current "
"list of supported languages"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1501
#, no-c-format
msgid "Festival"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1502
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"American English, British, Spanish, German, Finnish, Czech, Polish, Russian, "
"Italian, French Canadian, Kiswahili, Zulu, and Ibibio"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1511
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It also works with any synthesis engine that can be run from a command in a "
"&konsole;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1514
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The languages listed above may not be comprehensive or up-to-date. Check the "
"specifications for each engine for a complete list of supported languages. "
"Also check the <ulink url=\"http://accessibility.kde.org/developer/kttsd/"
"index.php\"> &ktts;</ulink> website for additional information that might "
"not have made it into this handbook."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1524
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"speech-dispatcher uses a flexible plugin architecture for speech synthesis "
"engines. If you want to enhance &ktts; to support another engine, contact "
"the development team."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1531
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"See <xref linkend=\"configuration\"/> for specific instructions for each of "
"these engines."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1539
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optional components:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1545
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <command>xsltproc</command> utility is needed for SSML support and for "
"the &XML; Transformer filter, but not required. Debian users can install "
"xsltproc with the command <command>apt-get install xsltproc</command>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1559
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compilation and Installation"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1567
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to compile &ktts;, you must have a recent (&kde; 4.4 or greater) "
"copy of the &kde; development files, including kdelibs and the development "
"files for speech-dispatcher."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1571
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you downloaded the &ktts; source from the <filename>kdeaccessibility</"
"filename> code repository module, or downloaded the nightly tarball, use the "
"following commands to compile and install."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:1576
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"cd kdeaccessibility\n"
"mkdir build\n"
"cd build\n"
"cmake ../\n"
"make\n"
"sudo make install"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1584
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuracion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1586
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure speech-dispatcher is working with your speech synthesis engine "
"before using &ktts;. The shell script spd-conf can be used for that."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1589
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ktts; in &kde; 4.4 is a first attempt at porting &ktts; to use speech-"
"dispatcher. In the future kttsmgr will be able to configure speech-"
"dispatcher directly without spd-conf."
msgstr ""

